{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987720/extras/9c7a09e2473932c085a0cbeba3a05405.avif?t=1758833373\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a thousand years of slumber, the world is no longer the same. Humanity has changed, civilizations have fallen\u2026 yet Easter Island remains silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying your retirement on this quiet island, all you have to do is keep clicking and harvesting dozens of crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Let the ancient vampire\u2019s night harvest begin! \ud83c\udf1b\ud83e\udd87</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Basic Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking more tiles gives you access to new crop varieties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking boosts planting, watering, fertilizing, harvesting, and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your stamina lets you work longer in the field. (Stamina refills when you sleep.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer helps your crops grow 2x faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protector bats keep your crops safe from pests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your inventory lets you carry more crops to the market, allowing you to earn more points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sit back and enjoy discovering 55+ crop varieties.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987720?t=1758833373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987720?t=1758833373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987720/d84327391d508c93a84f05a9c95e514771aa7887/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758833373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987720/d84327391d508c93a84f05a9c95e514771aa7887/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758833373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987720/extras/9c7a09e2473932c085a0cbeba3a05405.avif?t=1758833373\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a thousand years of slumber, the world is no longer the same. Humanity has changed, civilizations have fallen\u2026 yet Easter Island remains silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying your retirement on this quiet island, all you have to do is keep clicking and harvesting dozens of crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Let the ancient vampire\u2019s night harvest begin! \ud83c\udf1b\ud83e\udd87</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Basic Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking more tiles gives you access to new crop varieties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking boosts planting, watering, fertilizing, harvesting, and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your stamina lets you work longer in the field. (Stamina refills when you sleep.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer helps your crops grow 2x faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protector bats keep your crops safe from pests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your inventory lets you carry more crops to the market, allowing you to earn more points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sit back and enjoy discovering 55+ crop varieties.</strong></p>","developers":["mikolus"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3919620","name":"Fangs to Fields"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987720/6eecac1e78e4c5d6a81436b2a2fe5ea781ae60df/header.jpg?t=1758833373","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987720/216030404/91b0ff1c933715e3f41a0175509bd5551819be50/1758454410/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758455689","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987720/216030404/91b0ff1c933715e3f41a0175509bd5551819be50/1758454410/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758455689","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987720/216030404/91b0ff1c933715e3f41a0175509bd5551819be50/1758454410/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758455689","id":257203221,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203221/movie480.mp4?t=1758455689","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203221/movie_max.mp4?t=1758455689"},"name":"Fangs to Fields - Idle Harvest Game on Your Desktop","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203221/779124f26a1a9e85faf983ea165ef9000d87e15c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758455689","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203221/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758455689","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203221/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758455689"}}],"name":"Fangs to Fields Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum"